      "html": "<p>Aquarium plant from tissue culture in closed cup. This Myriophyllum keeps its bright, green colour even at very high light intensity. Every stem will only measure approximately 2-3 cm (1\"), but it branches willingly and the plant quickly becomes dense and lush. Its moderate growth makes Myriophyllum 'Guyana' particularly adapted to nano tanks.</p>"
